{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19056","headline":"和李相公初归平泉过龙门南岭遥望山居即事 · 刘禹锡","name":"和李相公初归平泉过龙门南岭遥望山居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂别明庭去，初随优诏还。\n曾爲鹏鸟赋，喜过凿龙山。\n新墅烟火起，野程泉石间。\n岩廊人望在，只得片时闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}